entry_messages = ["Look at this one honey! It'll look great as your profile picture...", "No you don't look fat in it...", "Yea let's do some for me...", "What if I posed like this?...", "Or maybe like that?", "Oh! I've got it! I'll take this stone and pose like I'm building this place. Ha-ha-ha. Could you imagine? Me building Stonehenge?", "H-honey?... Wha-what happened?... Where am I?..."]
